# CI and hooks

- Workflows must pin third-party actions by major version (`@v4`, `@v5`) and request least privilege (`contents: read` unless a job needs more).
- Triggers: `push` to `main`, `pull_request`, and `workflow_dispatch`. Add `paths:` filters only when a workflow is expensive.
- Mirror local pre-commit in CI. Do not add a CI-only linter without adding it to `.pre-commit-config.yaml` (or document why).
- Keep jobs cancellable via `concurrency` groups so superseded PR runs stop.
- Dependabot covers `github-actions` and `pip` weekly. Review those PRs; do not ignore failed CI on them.
